@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
# 先在 .env 启用本地学生身份并重启 API；从实际响应复制三个 UUID。
@mistake_id = REPLACE_MISTAKE_UUID
@item_id = REPLACE_DAILY_ITEM_UUID
@practice_id = REPLACE_PRACTICE_UUID

### 完整替换学习偏好，grade 1–12 可选
PUT {{base}}/v1/learning/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{"grade":8,"timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","daily_enabled":true,"generation_time":"19:00","daily_limit":5}

### 主动生成（同日幂等）
POST {{base}}/v1/learning/daily-tasks

### 查看今天任务
GET {{base}}/v1/learning/daily-tasks/today

### 关联任务项创建练习
POST {{base}}/v1/mistakes/{{mistake_id}}/practice-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"daily_task_item_id":"{{item_id}}"}

### 提交实际作答（新作答使用新幂等键；重试保留原键）
POST {{base}}/v1/mistakes/{{mistake_id}}/attempts
Idempotency-Key: daily-attempt-001
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LearningBoundary

--LearningBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="text"

4
--LearningBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="practice_id"

{{practice_id}}
--LearningBoundary--

### 查看知识点表现（未确认目录映射时 items 可为空）
GET {{base}}/v1/learning/abilities
